# =============================================================================
#
# SECURITY CONSIDERATIONS:
#
# 1. Non-root User Execution:
#    - Container runs as nodejs user (UID 1001) for security compliance
#    - Follows Principle of Least Privilege reducing attack surface
#    - Prevents privilege escalation attacks
#
# 2. Minimal Base Image:
#    - Alpine Linux provides minimal attack surface
#    - Regular security updates through base image updates
#    - Reduced container size improves security and performance
#
# 3. Multi-stage Build Security:
#    - Separates build dependencies from runtime image
#    - Excludes development tools and build artifacts
#    - Minimizes final image size and potential vulnerabilities
#
# 4. Dependency Security:
#    - npm audit integration during build process
#    - Production-only dependencies reduce attack surface
#    - Regular dependency updates through automated pipelines
#
# 5. Process Security:
#    - dumb-init prevents zombie processes and signal handling issues
#    - PM2 provides process isolation and automatic restart capabilities
#    - Proper signal handling for graceful shutdowns
#
# =============================================================================
#
# PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATIONS:
#
# 1. Multi-stage Build Benefits:
#    - Aggressive layer caching reduces build times by 50-80%
#    - Minimal final image size (typically 100-200MB vs 800MB+ without optimization)
#    - Faster container startup through reduced I/O operations
#
# 2. PM2 Cluster Mode:
#    - Automatic scaling to available CPU cores
#    - Built-in load balancer distributes requests efficiently
#    - Zero-downtime deployment through sequential worker restart
#
# 3. Node.js Optimizations:
#    - --max-old-space-size=1024 prevents memory-related crashes
#    - --optimize-for-size reduces memory footprint
#    - Production environment eliminates development overhead
#
# 4. Container Optimizations:
#    - Alpine Linux reduces memory usage and startup time
#    - Optimized layer structure improves Docker build cache efficiency
#    - Minimal file system reduces container attack surface
#
# =============================================================================
#
# MONITORING AND OBSERVABILITY:
#
# 1. Health Check Integration:
#    - Built-in health check endpoint (/health) for load balancer integration
#    - Container-native health monitoring with configurable intervals
#    - Support for Kubernetes liveness and readiness probes
#
# 2. PM2 Monitoring:
#    - Real-time process monitoring with pm2 monit command
#    - Automatic restart on failures with exponential backoff
#    - Resource usage tracking and alerting capabilities
#
# 3. Logging Configuration:
#    - Structured JSON logging for production environments
#    - Log rotation and centralized log management
#    - Integration with external logging systems (ELK, Fluentd, etc.)
#
# 4. Metrics Collection:
#    - Application performance metrics through PM2 monitoring
#    - Container resource metrics through Docker/Kubernetes
#    - Custom business metrics through application instrumentation
#
# =============================================================================
#
# MAINTENANCE AND UPDATES:
#
# 1. Base Image Updates:
#    - Regular Alpine Linux updates for security patches
#    - Node.js LTS updates for stability and security
#    - Automated rebuild pipelines for dependency updates
#
# 2. Dependency Management:
#    - npm audit integration for vulnerability detection
#    - Automated dependency updates through Dependabot or similar
#    - Regular security scanning of container images
#
# 3. Configuration Management:
#    - Environment-based configuration through environment variables
#    - Secrets management through external secret stores
#    - Configuration validation during container startup
#
# 4. Backup and Recovery:
#    - Stateless application design enables easy recovery
#    - Configuration and code stored in version control
#    - Database and persistent data handled separately
#
# =============================================================================